{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"89fb8781-5134-483f-88cc-0c27170f1349","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have inspected the attached screenshot and corresponding task record:\n\n### What the screenshot shows:\nThe screenshot is from the desktop app (Daily Assistant on the Antigravity runtime):\n- **User message:** `\"her\"` with a context file attachment thumbnail `10.png` (`image/png`).\n- **Assistant response:** `\"It looks like the image or text didn't come through yet! Could you paste the image here, or briefly tell me the main heading and the buttons you see on the screen? I'll guide you right away.\"`\n\n### Identified Problem:\nImage context files attached in the UI do not reach or are not parsed/perceived by the model when running under the Antigravity backend runtime.\n\nWould you like me to begin investigating the codebase (specifically the AGY backend input mapping, context file handling, and how multimodal context files are passed to Antigravity vs. Claude/Codex/native)?\n","duration_seconds":16.005099,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":68571,"output_tokens":785,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":0,"total_tokens":69356}}}
